From d4c2f05b3a9b72bcf8604ddfe2a498c83a9fc811 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amelia Crate <amelia.crate@chainguard.dev>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 16:32:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] crypto: reusable jitterentropy

Use 6.18 jitterentropy source code. This is mostly minor improvements.
We're doing this because it allows us to say that our 6.12 and
6.18 jitterentropy object builds are actually the same thing but
built for two different platforms, which means we can submit them at the same
time.
---
 crypto/jitterentropy-kcapi.c     |  1 +
 crypto/jitterentropy-optimized.c |  1 +
 crypto/jitterentropy-shim.c      |  9 +++++++++
 crypto/jitterentropy-shim.h      |  3 +++
 crypto/jitterentropy-testing.c   | 32 +++++++++++++++++---------------
 crypto/jitterentropy.c           |  5 ++---
 crypto/jitterentropy.h           |  5 +++--
 7 files changed, 36 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crypto/jitterentropy-kcapi.c b/crypto/jitterentropy-kcapi.c
index 01c64a66b59f0..b180b17eace4c 100644
